= The October Revolution

After the events in February with the fall of the Tzar the Bolsheviks have overthrown the Provisional Government.

We have many thoughts about this.

- @support: We must congratulate the Bolsheviks in Russia! 
- @denounce: This is too hasty.

@support
subtitle: Long live the Revolution!
on-arrival: {!
	Q.soviet_relation += 10
!}

Some of our members have mixed feelings, but nevertheless they still congratulate the Bolsheviks.

@denounce
on-arrival: {!
	Q.soviet_relation -= 10
!}

Some of our members have mixed feelings, but nevertheless agree to denounce the Bolsheviks.

